      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Are you some sort of hydro-deity descending from the heavens? No, no, no—you are just an engineer who knows how to manipulate localized moisture fields. By condensing the absolute essence of water and tidal forces into a single glowing gem, you have conquered the hydrosphere. The oceans and rivers of the world are no longer obstacles; they are your domain.\n\nFunctionally, keeping this amulet in your inventory or active hotbar grants you the ability to breathe indefinitely underwater. Better yet, it allows you to literally walk on the surface of water as if it were solid glass. Finally, it acts as an absolute, infinite source of water—perfect for instantly filling up those thirsty GregTech steam boilers or chemical vats without needing to run miles of plumbing!",
